WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.824
Some bike problems show only in the bytes. Now Diagnostics keeps a packet log, on

00:00:07.824 --> 00:00:08.901
this device.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.057
By default it keeps the commands sent to the bike: every resistance change and

00:00:15.057 --> 00:00:18.087
keepalive, counted in commands and kilobytes.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:28.070
Turn on Log every packet while you reproduce a problem, and the bike's messages are

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.179
kept too, with a Recording tag.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.494
Download packet log saves a JSON Lines file for the day: one object per message,

00:00:41.494 --> 00:00:44.943
with its time, direction, frame type and bytes.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:54.633
Two acceptance tests failed first and pass now. The log holds ten megabytes at most,

00:00:54.633 --> 00:00:58.796
and errors reach only the console, with no email or token.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:04.747
The packet log, from a phone to the full screen.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:16.869
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:17.214 --> 00:01:21.726
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:21.726 --> 00:01:23.397
every hill and interval.

00:01:23.742 --> 00:01:28.920
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:34.368
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:34.368 --> 00:01:37.358
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:37.704 --> 00:01:40.196
A custom workout lives under Profile.
